hadiths[99]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki, aur is mein tha: Us ke liye us ka dohra ajar hai."
"1402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ghulam apne aaqa ki khair-khwahi kare aur apne Rabb ki achche tareeqe se ibadat kare to us ke liye dohra ajar hai."
"1403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jab ghulam apne aaqa ki khair-khwahi kare aur achche tareeqe se Allah ki ibadat kare to us ke liye us ka dohra ajar hai."
"1404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab zamana (Qayamat ka) bilkul qareeb hoga to maut meri ummat ke behtareen logon ko khatm kar degi jis tarah tum mein se koi tast se paki hui taza khajooron ko khatm karta hai."
"1405","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab momin ko koi takleef pohanchti hai to woh use gunahon se saaf kar deti hai jaise bhatti lohe ko mel kuchail se saaf karti hai."
"1407","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak banda jab beemar hota hai to us ki beemari mein Allah us se gunahon ko is tarah saaf kar deta hai jis tarah bhatti lohe ka mel kuchail saaf karti hai."
"1408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala jab apna faisla aur taqdeer nafiz farmana chahta hai to aqal walon ki aqlein salb kar leta hai yahan tak ke un mein apna faisla aur taqdeer nafiz farma deta hai."
"1409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salamti ke liye beemari kafi hai."
"1410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Wa'z o naseehat ke liye maut kafi hai, ghani ke liye yaqeen kafi hai aur mashghooliyat ke liye ibadat kafi hai."
"1411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke gunahgar hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh jin ki khurak ka zimmedar hai unhen zaya kar de."
"1412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ko yahi kafi hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Aadmi ke gunahgar hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh jin ki kafalat karta hai unhen zaya kar de."
"1414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Aadmi ke gunahgar hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh apne bhai ke bare mein woh baat kahe jo us mein payi jati ho, pas jis ne apne bhai ke bare mein woh baat kahi jo us mein payi jati thi to beshak us ne us (bhai) ki gheebat ki aur jis ne us (bhai) ke bare mein aisi baat kahi jo us mein nahin thi to beshak us ne us (bhai) ka gosht khaya."
"1415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke gunahgar hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh har suni sunayi baat aage bayan kar de."
"1416","[AI-translation] Hafs bin Aasim Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke gunahgar hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh har suni sunayi baat aage bayan kar de."
"1417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke sa'adat-mand hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke us ke deeni aur dunyawi kaam mein us par bharosa kiya jae."
"1418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya aur us waqt Aap Mina mein the: Ba'z auqat jis shakhs ko hadees pohanchayi jati hai woh (barah-e-rast) sunne wale se zyada yaad rakhne wala hota hai."
"1419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur main ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya hai."
"1420","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat ek doosri sanad se bhi Simak bin Harb se un ki sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai."
"1421","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein Khaif ke muqam par khade ho kar farmaya: Allah us bande ko tar-o-taza rakhe jis ne meri baat sun kar mehfooz kar li phir use un tak pohancha diya jinhon ne use nahin suna tha. Ba'z auqat hamil-e-fiqh aisa hota hai jise us (hadees) ki fiqh (samajh boojh) nahin hoti aur ba'z auqat hamil-e-fiqh aisa bhi hota hai jo apne se badh kar faqeeh tak pohancha deta hai. Aur unhon ne mukammal hadees bayan ki."
"1422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us bande ko tar-o-taza rakhe jis ne mera kalam suna aur us mein (apni taraf se) izafa na kiya. Ba'z auqat hamil-e-hikmat o danayi aisa bhi hota hai jo apne se badh kar us ko mehfooz rakhne wale tak pohancha deta hai. Teen cheezon mein momin ka dil kabhi khayanat nahin karta: Allah ke liye ikhlas ke sath amal karna, hukmaranon ki khair-khwahi karna aur Musalmanon ki jama'at ko lazim pakadna kyunke un ki dawat (dua) un ko chaaron taraf se gher leti hai."
"1423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Jubair (Raziyallahu anhu) jo ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke as'haab mein se hain, kehte hain ke ek din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sakht bhook lagi Aap ne apne pet par pathar rakh liya phir farmaya: Suno! Kitni hi jaanein aisi hain jo duniya mein to khoob khane peene wali, naaz o nemat mein rehne wali hain lekin Qayamat ke din bhooki nangi hon gi. Suno! Kitne hi log aise hain jo apne nafs ki izzat karne wale hain halanke woh use zaleel karne wale hain. Suno! Kitne hi log aise hain jo apne nafs ko zaleel karne wale hain halanke (haqeeqat mein) woh us ki izzat karne wale hain. Suno! Kitne hi aise hain jo un cheezon mein jo Allah ne apne Rasul ko bator-e-fay ata ki hain zabardasti ghusne wale aish o ishrat chahne wale hain halanke Allah Ta'ala ke han un ka koi hissa nahin. Suno! Beshak Jannat ka amal sakht oonchi mushkilon mein ghera hua hai. Suno! Beshak dozakh ka amal aasan lazzat o shahwat ke sath ghera hua hai. Suno! Kitni hi aisi khwahishat hain jin ki lazzat ek ghadi ki hai lekin woh lambe arse ke gham ka waris bana deti hain."
"1424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kitne hi qiyam karne wale aise hain jinhen sawae raat bhar jaagne ke kuch nahin milta aur kitne hi roza-dar aise hain jinhen un ke roze se sawae bhook aur pyas ke kuch nahin milta."
"1425","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kitne hi qiyam karne wale aise hain jinhen un ke qiyam mein se raat bhar jaagne hi ka hissa milta hai aur kitne hi roza-dar aise hain jinhen un ke roze mein se bhook aur pyas hi ka hissa milta hai."
"1426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kitne hi roza-dar aise hain jinhen un ke roze mein se bhook aur pyas ke siwa koi hissa nahin milta aur kitne hi qiyam karne wale aise hain jinhen un ke qiyam mein se raat bhar jaagne ke siwa koi hissa nahin milta."
"1427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Kitne hi khana kha kar shukr ada karne wale aise hain jo ajar mein roza rakh kar sabr karne walon se badh kar hain."
"1428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar sa'il jhoot na bolte to unhen khali hath lautane wale azab se kabhi mehfooz na rehte."
"1429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tumhen maloom ho jata jo main janta hun to tum kam hanste aur zyada rote."
"1430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tumhen maloom ho jata jo main janta hun to tum zyada rote aur kam hanste."
"1431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tumhen maloom ho jata jo main janta hun to tum zyada rote aur kam hanste. Aur tum mein se har ek (itna lamba) sajda karta yahan tak ke us ki kamar toot jati aur (is qadar) cheekhta chillata ke us ki awaz khatm ho jati. Roya karo, agar rona na aae to rone jaisi soorat bana liya karo."
"1432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1433","[AI-translation] 1433 - Aur Abu Muhammad bin Nahhas se riwayat hai, (unhon ne kaha): Ibn Arabi ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibrahim (jo Ibn Fahd hain) ne hamein bayan kiya, Muslim ne hamein bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, Sulaiman bin Marsad se, Abu Darda se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Muslim bin Hajjaj ne zikr kiya aur riwayat kiya, Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah se, Abdullah bin Numair se, Hisham bin Urwah se, un ke walid se, Aishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek taweel hadees mein, aur is mein: Allah ki qasam, agar tumhen maloom ho jata jo main janta hun to tum zyada rote aur kam hanste. ... hadees."
"1434","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umayyah bint Sabiyyah Juhaniyyah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar chaupaye maut ko jaan lein jaise Ibn Adam janta hai to tum kisi mote janwar ko na khao."
"1435","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein wa'z karte hue farmaya: Agar tum maut aur us ki raftaar ko dekh lo to ummeed aur us ke dhoke se zaroor nafrat karne lago."
"1436","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum maut aur us ki raftaar ko dekh lo to ummeed aur us ke dhoke se zaroor nafrat karne lago. Koi ghar wale aise nahin jin ki Malkul Maut rozana ek baar khabargiri na karta ho. Phir jis ki umar poori ho chuki hoti hai to us ki woh rooh qabz kar leta hai, us ke ghar wale rone peetne lagte hain to woh kehta hai: Tum kyun ro peet rahe ho? Allah ki qasam! Main ne tumhare liye na (us ki) umar kam ki hai aur na rizq roka hai, mera kya gunah hai? Mujhe to tumhare paas baar baar aana hai."
"1437","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar momin choohe ke bil mein bhi ho to wahan bhi Allah Ta'ala us ke liye eza-rasan paida kar dega."
"1438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak agar momin kisi bil mein bhi ho to wahan bhi Allah us ke liye eza-rasan paida kar dega."
"1439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek is duniya ka wazan machchar ke ek par jitna bhi hota to woh kisi kafir ko is mein se pani ka ek ghoont bhi naseeb na karta."
"1440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Allah ke nazdeek is duniya ki haisiyat machchar ke par jitni bhi hoti to woh kisi kafir ko is mein se pani ka ek ghoont bhi naseeb na karta."
"1441","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ibn Adam ke paas agar maal ki (bhari hui) do wadiyan hon to woh un ke sath zaroor teesri wadi bhi talash karega aur Ibn Adam ka pet (qabr ki) mitti ke ilawa koi cheez nahin bharti aur Allah us ki tauba qabool farmata hai jo tauba kare."
"1442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqqad Laisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya hai ke beshak hum ne namaz qaim karane aur zakat dilwane ke liye maal nazil kiya hai. Agar Ibn Adam ke paas (maal ki) ek wadi ho to woh yahi chahega ke us ke paas do wadiyan hon aur agar us ke paas do wadiyan hon to woh yahi chahega ke us ke sath teesri bhi ho aur Ibn Adam ka pet (qabr ki) mitti ke ilawa koi cheez nahin bharti aur Allah us ki tauba qabool farmata hai jo tauba kare."
"1443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ibn Adam ke paas agar do wadiyan hon, yani us ke maal ki, to woh un ke sath zaroor teesri bhi talash karega. Baqi matan wahi hai jo doosri hadees ka hai. Aur use Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat kiya hai ke agar Ibn Adam ke paas maal ki do wadiyan hon to woh zaroor teesri bhi talash karega."
"1444","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar waqa'i tum Allah par is tarah bharosa karo jaise us par bharosa karne ka haq hai to woh tumhen is tarah rizq de jaise parindon ko rizq deta hai jo subah (apne ghonslon se) bhooke nikalte hain aur shaam ko sair ho kar aate hain."
"1445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Agar waqa'i tum Allah par is tarah bharosa karo jaise us par bharosa karne ka haq hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1446","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah na karte to Allah Ta'ala (tumhari jagah) aisi qaum le aata jo gunah karti to woh unhen bakhshish deta aur Jannat mein dakhil kar deta."
"1447","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah na karte to mujhe tum par us (gunah ke wabal) se bhi sakht cheez ka darr tha (aur woh hai) fakhr o ghuroor."
"1448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya hai ke main apne bande ke guman ke mutabiq hun jo woh mere bare mein rakhta hai aur main apne bande ke sath hun jab woh mujhe yaad karta hai."
"1449","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya hai ke meri mohabbat un logon ke liye wajib hogayi jo meri khatir aapas mein mohabbat karte hain aur meri khatir ek doosre ki ziyarat karte hain."
"1450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya hai ... aur unhon ne is hadees ko mukhtasar bayan kiya."
"1451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai ke La ilaha illallah mera qila hai jo is mein dakhil ho gaya woh mere azab se mehfooz rahega."
"1452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe us shakhs par sakht ghussa aata hai jo kisi aise aadmi par zulm kare jo mere siwa apna koi madadgar na pata ho. Tabarani ne kaha: Use Abu Ishaq se sirf Shareek ne riwayat kiya hai aur use bayan karne mein Mas'ar munfarid hai."
"1453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Ae duniya! Tu mere doston ke liye kadwi ho ja, un ke liye meethi na hona warna tu unhen fitne mein daal degi."
"1454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla duniya se farmata hai: Ae duniya! Tu us ki khadim ban ja jo mera khadim bane aur ae duniya! Tu us ko thaka de jo tera khadim bane."
"1455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Jis shakhs ko mere zikr ne mujh se sawal karne se mashghool o masroof rakha main use us se behtar dunga jo main sawal karne walon ko deta hun."
"1456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jibreel Alaihissalam se, woh Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala se riwayat karte hue kehte hain ke Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala farmata hai: Jis ne mere kisi wali ki ehanat ki to beshak us ne mujhe khule aam jang ki dawat di aur main kisi cheez mein jise main karne wala hun itna taraddud nahin karta jitna apne momin bande ki rooh qabz karne mein karta hun (kyunke) woh maut ko (b wajah takleef-e-jismani) napasand karta hai aur main bhi use takleef dena napasand karta hun aur us ke siwa us ke liye koi chara bhi nahin hota."
"1457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Jis ne mere kisi wali ko takleef di us ne meri haram kardah cheezon ko halal kar liya aur faraiz ki adayegi jaisa kisi bande ne mera qurb hasil nahin kiya aur beshak mera banda nawafil ke zariye mera qurb hasil karta rehta hai hatta ke main us se mohabbat karne lagta hun (phir) agar woh mujhe pukare to main use jawab deta hun aur agar woh mujh se mange to main use ata karta hun aur main kisi cheez se jise main karne wala hun aisa taraddud nahin karta jaisa us (apne bande) ki maut se karta hun kyunke woh maut ko (b wajah takleef-e-jismani) napasand karta hai aur main bhi use takleef dena napasand karta hun."
"1458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne Musa Alaihissalam se ek lakh chalees hazar kalimat ke sath guftagu farmayi jo sari ki sari waseeyatein thin pas jo guftagu hui us mein yeh irshad bhi tha ke ae Musa! Haqeeqat yahi hai ke mere liye tasannu' o takalluf karne walon ne duniya mein zuhd jaisa tasannu' o takalluf nahin kiya aur qurb hasil karne walon ne meri haram ki hui cheezon se bachne aur parhez karne jaisa qurb hasil nahin kiya aur ibadat karne walon ne mere khauf se rone ki misl ibadat nahin ki. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1459","[AI-translation] Jubair se ek aur sanad ke sath marwi hai ke farmaya: Ae Musa! Haqeeqat yahi hai ke tasannu' o takalluf karne walon ne duniya mein zuhd jaisa tasannu' o takalluf nahin kiya aur qurb hasil karne walon ne meri haram ki hui cheezon se bachne aur parhez karne jaisa qurb hasil nahin kiya aur ibadat karne walon ne mere khauf se rone ki misl ibadat nahin ki."
"1460","[AI-translation] Juwairbir se mazeed ek sanad ke sath marwi hai: Haqeeqat yahi hai ke tasannu' o takalluf karne walon ne duniya mein zuhd jaisa tasannu' o takalluf nahin kiya aur qurb hasil karne walon ne meri haram ki hui cheezon se bachne aur parhez karne jaisa qurb hasil nahin kiya aur ibadat karne walon ne mere khauf se rone ki misl ibadat nahin ki."
"1461","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel Alaihissalam ne farmaya ke Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main ne is deen ko apne liye chun liya hai aur is ko sakhawat aur husn-e-khuluq ke ilawa koi cheez durust nahin rakh sakti lehaza tum un donon ke zariye use mu'azzaz o mohtaram karo jab tak us ke sath raho."
"1462","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap Jibreel Alaihissalam se, woh Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala se riwayat karte hain ke Allah ne farmaya: Jab main apne bandon mein se kisi bande ki taraf us ke badan, maal ya aulad mein koi museebat bhejun phir woh sabr-e-jameel ke sath us ka istiqbal kare to main us se Qayamat ke din is baat se haya karunga ke us ke liye meezan qaim karun ya us ke liye a'mal-nama kholun."
"1463","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Badayi meri chadar hai aur azmat mera izar hai, pas jis shakhs ne in mein se kisi ek ko mujh se chheene ki koshish ki main use aag mein phenk dunga."
"1464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap apne Rabb Ta'ala se riwayat karte hain, us ne farmaya: Azmat mera izar hai aur badayi meri chadar hai chunache jis shakhs ne in mein se kisi ek ko mujh se chheene ki koshish ki main use Jahannam mein phenk dunga."
"1465","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne is riwayat ko ek baar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak marfoo' bayan kiya aur ek baar Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) tak mauqoof bayan kiya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Badayi meri chadar hai aur azmat mera izar hai chunache jis shakhs ne in mein se koi mujh se chheenne ki koshish ki main use aag mein phenk dunga."
"1466","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki duaon mein se ek yeh bhi thi: Ae Allah! Beshak main aise ilm se teri panah mangta hun jo nafa-mand na ho, aise dil se jo darta na ho, aisi dua se jo qabool na ho aur aise nafs se jo sair na ho. Main un chaaron cheezon ke shar se teri panah mangta hun."
"1467","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat ek doosri sanad se bhi Khulaf bin Khalifah se un ki sanad ke sath is tarah marwi hai aur us ke aakhir mein yeh hai: Ae Allah! Beshak main un chaaron cheezon ke shar se teri panah mangta hun."
"1468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri panah mangta hun aise ilm se jo nafa-mand na ho, aise amal se jo teri bargah ki taraf na chadhe, aise dil se jo (tujh se) darta na ho aur aisi baat se jo suni na jae."
"1469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har waqt jab bhi mere ghar se bahar nikle to Aap ne apni nigah aasman ki janib uthayi aur yeh dua padhi: Ae Allah! Beshak main is baat se teri panah mangta hun ke gumrah ho jaun ya gumrah kiya jaun, phisal jaun ya phislaya jaun, zulm karun ya mujh par koi zulm kare, jahalat bartun ya mujh se koi jahalat barti jae."
"1470","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Atiyyah kehte hain ke Abdul Hakam bin Maimoon meri iyadat karne aae to unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke woh Sabit ke hamrah Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gae to unhon ne un ko yeh hadees bayan ki ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tashreef le gae us waqt woh kisi takleef mein mubtala the to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se teri jald aafiyat aur teri aazmayish par sabr aur duniya se teri rahmat ki taraf nikalne ka sawal karta hun."
"1471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karti hain ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is dua ke sath dua kiya karte the: Ae Allah! Mere liye bhalayi farma aur mere liye bhalayi hi ka intikhab kar."
"1472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Badri kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Tu ne meri soorat achchi banayi hai to meri seerat bhi achchi bana de."
"1473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Tu ne meri soorat achchi banayi hai to meri seerat bhi achchi bana de."
"1474","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se arz kiya: Batlayen agar mujhe Shab-e-Qadr ka ilm ho jae to main kaun si dua padhun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum yeh kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak tu mu'af karne wala hai mu'af karne ko pasand karta hai lehaza mujhe mu'af farma de."
"1475","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat ek aur sanad se bhi Jariri se un ki sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai."
"1476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Yeh mah-e-Ramazan aachuka hai to main kaun si dua padhun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum yeh kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak tu mu'af karne wala hai, mu'af karne ko pasand karta hai lehaza mujhe mu'af farma de."
"1477","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Batlayen agar main Shab-e-Qadr paun to us mein kaun si dua padhun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum yeh kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak tu mu'af karne wala hai mu'af karne ko pasand karta hai lehaza mujhe bhi mu'af farma de."
"1478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Agar main Shab-e-Qadr ko paun to us mein kaun si dua padhun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum yeh kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak tu mu'af karne wala hai mu'af karne ko pasand karta hai lehaza mujhe bhi mu'af farma de."
"1479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki duaon mein se ek yeh bhi thi: Ae Allah! Mere woh gunah mu'af farma jo main ne ghalti se kiye aur jo jaan boojh kar kiye, jo chhup kar kiye aur jo alaniya kiye, jo la-ilmi mein kiye aur jo jante boojhte hue kiye."
"1480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Husain Islam qabool karne se pehle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kehne laga: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Abdul Muttalib apni qaum ke liye behtar tha woh (janwaron ki) kaleji aur kohan ka gosht khilaya karta tha jabke aap to un (janwaron) ko mukammal zibah kar dete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jo Allah ne chaha jawab diya. Phir Husain kehne laga: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Aap mujhe kya padhne ka hukm dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main apne nafs ke shar se teri panah mangta hun aur main is baat ka tujh se sawal karta hun ke mujhe mere bhalayi ke kaam par pukhtagi ata farma de. Kehte hain: Phir us ke baad Husain Islam le aaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz karne laga: Beshak main ne pehli martaba bhi aap se sawal kiya tha aur ab bhi aap se sawal karta hun ke aap mujhe kya padhne ka hukm farmate hain? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum yeh kaho: Ae Allah! Mere woh gunah mu'af farma jo main ne chhup kar kiye aur jo alaniya kiye, jo ghalti se kiye aur jo jaan boojh kar kiye, jo la-ilmi mein kiye aur jo jante boojhte hue kiye."
"1481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak woh kamyab hua jis ne us (nafs) ko pak kiya. (Ash-Shams: 9) Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Mere nafs ko us ka taqwa ata farma aur use pak kar de tu use sab se behtar pak o saaf karne wala hai tu hi us ka karsaz aur malik hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us waqt namaz mein the."
"1482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab kisi qaum se andesha hota tha to Aap yun dua farmaya karte: Ae Allah! Beshak main un (dushmanon) ki shararaton se teri panah mangta hun aur tujhi ko un ke muqable mein pesh karta hun."
"1483","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ayyam-e-Khaibar mein apne honton ko harkat de rahe the, Aap se poocha gaya ke aap kya dua farma rahe hain? Aap ne farmaya: Main keh raha hun: (Ae Allah!) Main teri hi madad se chalta phirta hun, teri hi madad se ladayi karta hun aur teri hi madad se hamla-awar hota hun."
"1484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte hue farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Waleed ke bachane ki tarah bacha."
"1485","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat ek aur sanad se bhi Abdul Wahhab bin Duhak se un ki sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai."
"1486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Waleed ke bachane ki tarah bacha."
"1487","[AI-translation] Salim apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se Waleed ke bachane ki tarah bachane ka sawal karta hun."
"1488","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh dua farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! (Badr o Ahzab mein) tu ne Quraish ke pehle logon ko azab chakhaya tha ab un ke baad walon ko in'am o ikram se nawaz de."
"1489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke nabina aadmi se hajat hargiz na talab karo aur raat ke waqt bhi hajat hargiz na talab karo aur jab tum ne hajat talab karni ho to us aadmi se apne chehre ke sath mutawajjeh ho kyunke haya donon aankhon mein hoti hai aur subah ke waqt apni hajat ke liye niklo kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye us ke subah ke waqt mein barkat farma."
"1490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye us ke subah ke waqt mein barkat farma."
"1491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sakhr Ghamidi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh baat irshad farmayi hai."
"1492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate hue suna: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye us ke Jum'erat ke din subah ke waqt mein barkat farma."
"1493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sakhr Ghamidi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye us ke subah ke waqt mein barkat farma."
"1494","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nabit bin Shurit (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye us ke subah ke waqt mein barkat farma. Tabarani ne kaha: Nabit se yeh hadees sirf isi sanad ke sath marwi hai, use un ka beta un se bayan karne mein munfarid hai."
"1495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae aafiyat wale! Tamam aarzooein tujhi par muntahi hoti hain."
"1496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki duaon mein se ek yeh bhi thi: Parwardigar! Meri tauba qabool farma, mere gunah dho daal aur meri dua qabool kar."
"1497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab bhi kisi safar ka irada farmate to apni jagah se uthne se pehle yeh kalimat zaroor padhte: Ae Allah! Main teri taufeeq se utha, teri taraf mutawajjeh hua aur tujhi ko mazbooti se thama. Tu mera bharosa hai aur tu hi meri ummeed hai. Ae Allah! Mere ahem aur ghair ahem kaamon mein mujhe kafi ho ja, aur un mein bhi jin ko tu mujh se zyada janta hai. Ae Allah! Mujhe taqwa ka tosha ata farma, aur mere gunah bakhsh de aur main jahan kahin bhi munh karun mujhe khair ki taraf mutawajjeh kar. Rawi kehta hai ke phir Aap (yeh kalimat padh kar) safar ke liye rawana hote."
"1498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte hue farmaya karte the: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se e'tedal wali zindagi, saaf suthri maut aur aisi aaqibat ka sawal karta hun jis mein koi zillat o ruswayi na ho."
"1499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte hue farmaya karte: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se saaf suthri zindagi aur aasani wali maut aur aisi aaqibat ka sawal karta hun jis mein koi zillat o ruswayi na ho."
